### Health Check - Liveness
# Checks if the HTTP server is alive and responding.
GET {{host}}/api/health/live
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 OK");
        client.assert(response.body.status === "ok", "Expected status ok");
    });
%}

###

### Health Check - Readiness
# Checks if database, cache/redis, and external dependencies are ready.
GET {{host}}/api/health/ready
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 OK");
        client.assert(response.body.status === "ready", "Expected status ready");
    });
%}
